    }
    Dataset --&gt; COG : ds.cog
    write_cog ..&gt; COG : delegates</code></pre> <p><code>Dataset.to_cog(...)</code> is the single owner of write policy; the multi-input <code>write_cog(...)</code> facade (NumPy array / <code>xarray.DataArray</code> / <code>gdal.Dataset</code> / path / <code>Dataset</code>) normalises its input and delegates to it, so both produce identical output.</p>
